  "prompt": "User 278's app events from 09:00 to 09:40 UTC on 20 November 2025 are at 09:00:00, 09:02:20, 09:06:50, 09:36:51 and 09:38:26 (event_ids 85929, 85940, 85968, 86123 and 86126). Which result does this query return?",
